VERDICTS. The rule reads the MODE-MATCHED ratio Q/S_n: the whole-plane quadrature of the FAST filter against the Stone band 0..max_order with no mode removed. Both sets then hold the SAME modes, and the quadrature carries no grid truncation. The rule takes the worst case: within 10% MATCH, to 40% MEASURED DIFFERENCE, else INVESTIGATE.
